+//   R1  the 81 hard-by-meaning cards of the second re-review (migrations/default-approve-2.cards.mjs) in 8 shapes, with the gate forced to fleet by a pull request, by
+//       worker.js, and with the act only in the title, the why or the action, are never approved; the 32 + 30 + 40 reversible cards are; a decision with no fleet_proof
